I am managing a software development project and require assistance with organizing and overseeing various tasks for my team. I'd like to establish a project timeline for the "Software Development Project" initiating on the 1st of April, 2023, and culminating on the 1st of October, 2023. Furthermore, I need to delegate specific tasks to my team members, such as "Design Database Schema" to be assigned to one developer (developer_001) with a deadline of the 15th of April, 2023, and "Implement Authentication System" to be assigned to another developer (developer_002) with a deadline of the 22nd of April, 2023. It is also crucial for me to closely monitor and track the progress of these tasks for the project identified by "proj_12345".

Please utilize the appropriate functions to create a timeline for the stated project, assign the indicated tasks to the specified team members within the set deadlines, and enable the tracking of task progress for the project with the ID "proj_12345". I am looking to confirm the successful scheduling, assignment, and ongoing management of these tasks as part of our project management efforts.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "createProjectTimeline", "args": {"project_name": "Software Development Project", "start_date": "2023-04-01", "end_date": "2023-10-01"}}]}
<|end|>


