<|user|>
I'm analyzing our company's sales performance over the past year and need to visualize the data to identify trends and patterns effectively. I have collected the monthly sales figures, categorized our product sales figures, and recorded sales across different regions. I'd like to request the creation of visualizations that will assist us in understanding our sales dynamics better.

Here's the data we have:

Monthly Sales Trend (in USD):
```
January, 12000
February, 15000
March, 13000
April, 16000
May, 14000
June, 17000
July, 15000
August, 18000
September, 16000
October, 19000
November, 17000
December, 20000
```

Sales by Product Category (in USD):
```
Electronics, 45000
Clothing, 30000
Home Appliances, 35000
Toys, 15000
Books, 18000
```

Regional Sales Distribution (in USD):
```
North America, 70000
Europe, 50000
Asia, 40000
South America, 20000
Australia, 10000
Africa, 5000
```

With this data, could you please generate the following visualizations:
1. A line chart that represents the "Monthly Sales Trend" with months on the x-axis and sales figures on the y-axis.
2. A bar chart that compares the "Sales by Product Category" where each category represents a bar with the height proportional to the sales figures.
3. A pie chart that shows the "Regional Sales Distribution" to illustrate how sales are spread across different regions, each region represented as a slice.

These visualizations will enable us to effectively communicate our sales insights to the team and make informed decisions.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "generate_line_chart", "args": {"data": "January, 12000\nFebruary, 15000\nMarch, 13000\nApril, 16000\nMay, 14000\nJune, 17000\nJuly, 15000\nAugust, 18000\nSeptember, 16000\nOctober, 19000\nNovember, 17000\nDecember, 20000", "x_axis": "Months", "y_axis": "Sales (USD)", "title": "Monthly Sales Trend"}}]}
<|end|>


