| 22       | 80       | 0.85     | ... | 35       |
| 18       | 90       | 0.65     | ... | 38       |
| ...      | ...      | ...      | ... | ...      |
| 20       | 95       | 0.70     | ... | 37       |
```

Could you please apply Min-Max normalization using the `min_max_normalize` function to scale the features within the range of 0 to 1 for the `dataset_normalized.csv` file? This preprocessing will ensure that our machine learning algorithm evaluates all features fairly.
