Our organization requires the implementation of a synchronous data replication strategy to support our disaster recovery plan. We aim to ensure high availability and data consistency for our mission-critical applications and systems. Specifically, we need to establish a reliable and efficient data replication process between our primary data center, identified as "MainDataCenter," and our designated disaster recovery location named "OffsiteDRLocation." The data replication must adhere to a high data consistency level to maintain data integrity across both sites.

To achieve this, we request the activation of a synchronous data replication function, connecting the primary data center "MainDataCenter" with the disaster recovery location "OffsiteDRLocation," and ensuring a high level of data consistency during the replication process.

Can you call the necessary function to initiate this synchronous data replication, ensuring the parameters match our exact requirement for high data consistency?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "synchronous_data_replication", "args": {"primary_data_center": "MainDataCenter", "disaster_recovery_location": "OffsiteDRLocation", "data_consistency_level": "high"}}]}
<|end|>


