| StudentID | Name         | Major        | EnrollmentYear |
|-----------|--------------|--------------|----------------|
| S1001     | John Doe     | Mathematics  | 2019           |
| S2001     | Alice Johnson| Biology      | 2020           |
| S2002     | Bob Smith    | Mathematics  | 2020           |
| ...       | ...          | ...          | ...            |
```

I would like to request the following function calls to assist with these tasks:
1. Update the major of the student with ID 'S1001' to 'Computer Science' in the 'Students' table.
2. Retrieve a list of all students who enrolled in the year 2020 from the 'Students' table.

This will enable me to proceed with the academic records update and generate the necessary enrollment reports. Can you please initiate these function calls for me?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
