update001, Critical Security Patch, Size: 15MB
update002, System Performance Enhancer, Size: 30MB
update003, Database Update 5.2, Size: 25MB
...
updateN, Description, Size: XMB
```

In total, we have 'N' updates to schedule. Could you please assist me by generating an update schedule to distribute these updates across the next 7 days? Additionally, I would like to proceed with scheduling the first update (update001) to be executed tonight at 11:00 PM.

