1. Generate an update schedule for the provided list of software updates ('update001' to 'updateN'), ensuring that the updates are distributed over the course of the next 7 days.
2. The update process should start at 11:00 PM each day and avoid business hours.
3. Once the schedule is generated, proceed to schedule "update001" to be installed tonight, ensuring it is set for 11:00 PM as the designated start time.

I would appreciate your immediate assistance on this matter. Thank you.
<|end|>
