Subsequently, perform a maintenance check on Robot Unit RBT-221. Specifically, the battery levels need evaluation, given the recent power discharge anomalies, and the joint calibration must be reassessed to ensure precision in the arm movements.

Lastly, an inventory status report is required for item ITM-5678. Given fluctuations in demand, an up-to-date account of its stock levels will fortify our inventory planning and customer delivery commitments.

