I'm currently redecorating my living room and have decided to buy a new sofa. I'm interested in a modern style that would complement the contemporary aesthetic of the space. My budget for this purchase is between $500 and $1500. Ideally, I'd like the sofa to be functional as well as aesthetically pleasing, ensuring it fits well within the living room's dimensions and existing decor.

Could you assist me by searching for modern sofas that fall within my price range of $500 to $1500, specifically intended for a living room setting? I'm looking for a variety of options to choose from that meet these criteria. Please present me with the available selections so I can make an informed decision.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "search_furnishings", "args": {"category": "sofa", "style": "modern", "price_range": {"min": 500, "max": 1500}, "room": "living room"}}]}
<|end|>


