As the manager of a distribution network specializing in consumer electronic goods, I require specific functions to be executed in order to maintain and enhance our customer relationship management. I need to add a new customer profile for "TechGadgets Ltd.," with contact details: phone number "123-456-7890," email "contact@techgadgets.com," and physical address "123 Tech Avenue, Silicon Valley, CA." They are interested in categories such as "Smartphones," "Laptop Computers," and "Wearable Technology," and prefer email communication.

Additionally, I need to update the contact information for an existing customer with ID "CUST10432" to a new email "updatedemail@customerdomain.com."

I also need to track the status of an order with the ID "ORD789456" to provide the customer with a timely update.

Lastly, there is a need to analyze customer feedback stored in a file at "/path/to/feedback_data.json" to determine areas we can improve our service. This file contains structured data regarding customer ratings, comments, and suggestions from the last quarter.

Please execute the following functions with the provided real-world data to assist in managing these aspects of our customer relationships:

1. Add a new customer profile to the CRM system with the details provided for "TechGadgets Ltd."
2. Update the email address for the existing customer with ID "CUST10432."
3. Track the order status with the ID "ORD789456."
4. Analyze the customer feedback data from the specified JSON file to identify trends and service improvement opportunities.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "add_customer_profile", "args": {"customer_data": {"name": "TechGadgets Ltd.", "contact_details": {"phone": "123-456-7890", "email": "contact@techgadgets.com", "address": "123 Tech Avenue, Silicon Valley, CA"}, "preferences": {"product_categories": ["Smartphones", "Laptop Computers", "Wearable Technology"], "communication_channel": "email"}}}}]}
<|end|>


