For the text document "path/to/status_report.txt", please replace the existing content with the following summary:
```
Project Milestones:
- Q1 Completion: Design Phase - Achieved
- Q2 Goals: Development Phase - In Progress
Upcoming Deliverables:
- Beta Version Launch
- User Documentation Completion
```

For the spreadsheet "path/to/financials.xlsx", please update the following cells with the new quarterly earnings data:
- Cell B2: $250,000
- Cell B3: $275,000
- Cell B4: $300,000
- Cell B5: $320,000

For the presentation "path/to/project_update.pptx", enhance the layout of slide number 3 with the following details:
- Title: "Project Goals & Timelines"
- A clear bullet-point list of objectives
- A timeline graphic illustrating project milestones

Could you assist me by calling the appropriate functions to edit the text document, update the spreadsheet, and enhance the presentation layout as specified?
<|end|>
