<|user|>
I am a busy professional with a Zoom account using the email [zoom_account_email@example.com], and I often collaborate with team members who utilize Webex extensively. Given my dynamic schedule, I require an efficient way to manage my calendar and plan meetings across these two platforms. To streamline this process, I would like my Zoom account to be integrated with Google Calendar, and my Webex account (associated with the email [webex_account_email@example.com]) to be integrated with Microsoft Outlook. This integration is vital for seamless synchronization of my meetings and work appointments. Could you please assist me by calling the appropriate functions to set up these integrations?

To set up my Zoom integration:
- Zoom account email: zoom_account_email@example.com
- Calendar service: Google Calendar

To set up my Webex integration:
- Webex account email: webex_account_email@example.com
- Calendar service: Microsoft Outlook

I would like these integrations to be executed as quickly as possible so I can ensure all my upcoming client and team meetings are scheduled properly without conflicts. Please call the functions to perform these integrations in parallel.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "integrate_calendar_with_zoom", "args": {"zoom_account_email": "zoom_account_email@example.com", "calendar_service": "Google Calendar"}}]}
<|end|>


