As an entrepreneur managing a small business, I have a packed schedule with frequent activities like weekly team meetings every Tuesday at 10 am, client consultations on Thursdays twice a month, and quarterly project deadlines. It's essential for me to synchronize all these commitments in a calendar to oversee my daily commitments, as well as to anticipate weekly tasks and monthly agendas. I prefer using my Google Calendar for these purposes and would greatly benefit from automatic reminders and notifications for each event to keep me on track. Can you assist me by setting up an integration of my Google Calendar with my account, enabling me to view my schedule in a monthly format with reminders and notifications for events switched on?

I'll provide you with my user identifier for this purpose. Please use 'user_id: entrepreneur123', set 'calendar_type: google', 'view_type: monthly', and turn both 'reminders' and 'notifications' to true. This setup will ensure that I don't overlook any vital meetings or deadlines while navigating through my busy entrepreneurial journey.
