<|user|>
I am working on a location-based service for my mobile app and need to display the current location of the user with precise coordinates. I require high accuracy results to ensure the best user experience. Considering the nature of mobile usage, I don't want to rely on outdated location information, so please use fresh data. I'm not in a hurry, so you can take up to 30 seconds to get these coordinates. Also, to optimize performance, avoid using any cached positions older than 1 minute. Please call the necessary function to provide me with the current geolocation coordinates of the user with these specifications.

Here's the request to call the function to assist with my task:

```json
{
  "enableHighAccuracy": true,
  "timeout": 30000,
  "maximumAge": 60000
}
```
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "getCurrentLocation", "args": {"enableHighAccuracy": true, "timeout": 30000, "maximumAge": 60000}}]}
<|end|>


