1. Retrieve the sales figures for Q1 of 2023. This data is critical to establish our performance benchmarks.
2. Identify and display the top-performing products from the last quarter. Knowing which products performed best can guide our marketing strategy.
3. Update our sales forecast for Q2 based on the gathered sales data from Q1.

For the sales forecast, please use the following quarterly sales data:

```markdown
| Product         | Q1 2023 Sales    |
|-----------------|------------------|
| Product A       | $150,000         |
| Product B       | $180,000         |
| Product C       | $300,000         |
| Product D       | $250,000         |
| Product E       | $220,000         |
```

This information will help us accurately predict future sales trends and allocate resources efficiently. Could you please initiate the necessary function calls to perform these tasks and provide the analyzed output?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
