As a physician at our clinic, I need to review the comprehensive health record of a patient who recently visited. The patient's name is John Doe, and his unique identifier is 'JD7762'. His last visit was on April 10, 2023, where he mentioned symptoms of fatigue and shortness of breath. I need to ensure that his medication plan is up-to-date and check any lab results since his last visit. Please retrieve the full health record for patient ID 'JD7762', including all sections such as recent lab results and the current medication plan. This will assist in evaluating his condition and making necessary adjustments to his treatment.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "get_patient_health_record", "args": {"patient_id": "JD7762", "include_sections": ["lab_results", "medication_plan"]}}]}
<|end|>


