I am developing an Employee Onboarding App with Microsoft Power Apps for Acme Corp. We've recently hired John Smith, who will join the Legal Department as a Paralegal. His email is john.smith@acmecorp.com and he will start on May 15th, 2023. We need to register John in our system, assign him to the correct department, schedule an orientation session for him at our headquarters in Conference Room B on May 16th, 2023 at 9:00 AM, and send him a welcome email using template ID #HRWelcome1. Please initiate the necessary function calls with the following real-world data:

1. Register John Smith with the email john.smith@acmecorp.com in the Legal Department starting on 2023-05-15.
2. Assign John to department ID #LEGAL123, which corresponds to the Legal Department.
3. Schedule an orientation session for John with the identifier received when registering, for 2023-05-16T09:00:00 at location Conference Room B.
4. Send a welcome email to John using his unique identifier and the template ID #HRWelcome1.

Could you assist with these tasks using the functions provided?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "register_new_employee", "args": {"employee_name": "John Smith", "email": "john.smith@acmecorp.com", "department": "Legal", "start_date": "2023-05-15"}}]}
<|end|>


