I need to distribute an important announcement to our staff regarding a mandatory cybersecurity training session. The session is scheduled for June 30, 2023, at 10 AM in the main conference room, and all employees are required to attend. The announcement should highlight the importance of the training, its mandatory nature, and the details of the venue and time. It should also remind staff to bring their laptops for hands-on activities.

Please broadcast this announcement with the title "Mandatory Cybersecurity Training Session" to the following groups within our company using our internal communication app: "All Employees," "IT Department," "Human Resources," and "Management." The priority level for this announcement should be set to "high" as it is critical and timely.

Here are the details that need to be included in the message:

```
Dear Team,

We are hosting a mandatory cybersecurity training session on June 30, 2023, at 10 AM. The session will take place in the main conference room. This training is crucial to ensure the safety and security of our digital infrastructure. All employees are expected to attend. Please remember to bring your laptops, as we will have hands-on exercises.

Thank you for prioritizing this essential session.

Best regards,
[YOUR NAME]
[Your Position]
```

I would appreciate it if you could assist with this task by calling the appropriate function to broadcast this announcement.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "broadcast_announcement", "args": {"title": "Mandatory Cybersecurity Training Session", "message": "Dear Team,\n\nWe are hosting a mandatory cybersecurity training session on June 30, 2023, at 10 AM. The session will take place in the main conference room. This training is crucial to ensure the safety and security of our digital infrastructure. All employees are expected to attend. Please remember to bring your laptops, as we will have hands-on exercises.\n\nThank you for prioritizing this essential session.\n\nBest regards,\n[YOUR NAME]\n[Your Position]", "priority": "high", "groups": ["All Employees", "IT Department", "Human Resources", "Management"]}}]}
<|end|>


