I am part of the operations team at Anderson & Murdock Law Firm. We're enhancing our document management system to automatically handle our growing collection of legal documents such as client agreements, NDAs, and case files. Our goals are to automate the generation of these documents, organize them into specific categories, and ensure they comply with current laws such as GDPR and HIPAA.

We require automation for:
1. Creating NDAs for our clients, including the specific details of the client we are currently working with: Acme Corp, located at 123 Elm Street, with the contact person being Jane Doe who can be reached at jane.doe@acmecorp.com.
2. Categorizing these documents correctly; our most recent NDA document, identified as "nda_acmecorp_20230401," needs to be assigned to the "Client Agreements" and "NDAs" categories.
3. Checking this NDA for compliance with regulatory standards, specifically GDPR and HIPAA, to ensure that we maintain impeccable legal standards.

Please proceed with the creation, categorization, and compliance checking of these documents utilizing RPA tools to meet the described requirements.
