<|user|>
I am coordinating logistics for our trucking company and need to optimize our delivery routes to save time and fuel. Our fleet consists of 20 trucks, each with different capacities ranging from 5,000 kg to 15,000 kg and fuel efficiencies from 5 to 10 km per liter. We have scheduled 50 delivery locations needing service, all with specific delivery time windows. The deliveries must be completed within their respective time frames, minimizing the overall distance and fuel usage.

Below are the details of two trucks from our fleet and two delivery locations as examples:

Fleet Info:
- Truck 1: ID - T001, Capacity - 10,000 kg, Fuel Efficiency - 8 km/L
- Truck 2: ID - T002, Capacity - 12,000 kg, Fuel Efficiency - 7 km/L

Delivery Locations:
- Location 1: ID - L001, Address - 123 Main St, Springfield, Time Window Start - 2023-04-15T09:00:00Z, Time Window End - 2023-04-15T11:00:00Z
- Location 2: ID - L002, Address - 456 Elm St, Shelbyville, Time Window Start - 2023-04-15T12:00:00Z, Time Window End - 2023-04-15T14:00:00Z

I would like to call the 'generate_optimized_trucking_routes' function using the provided fleet information and delivery locations to generate the most efficient trucking routes. Please ensure that all 50 locations are included in the final route plan.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "generate_optimized_trucking_routes", "args": {"fleet_info": [{"truck_id": "T001", "capacity": 10000, "fuel_efficiency": 8}, {"truck_id": "T002", "capacity": 12000, "fuel_efficiency": 7}], "delivery_locations": [{"location_id": "L001", "address": "123 Main St, Springfield", "time_window": {"start": "2023-04-15T09:00:00Z", "end": "2023-04-15T11:00:00Z"}}, {"location_id": "L002", "address": "456 Elm St, Shelbyville", "time_window": {"start": "2023-04-15T12:00:00Z", "end": "2023-04-15T14:00:00Z"}}]}}]}
<|end|>


