Based on your capabilities, I request calls to the 'getCurrentAssetLocation' function using the asset's unique identifier, and to set up a subscription using the 'subscribeToAssetLocationUpdates' function with an update interval of 300 seconds. This will ensure continuous monitoring and improve our asset management effectiveness.
