- Update the inventory for truck TRK001 with the new stock for ITEM123.
- Generate a report showing current inventory levels for TRK001.
- Produce restock alerts for any item across all trucks that falls below 20 units.

I request to call the relevant functions to carry out these tasks. Here are the details to provide to the functions:

1. Update the inventory of truck TRK001 to reflect an addition of 50 units of ITEM123.
2. Monitor the inventory for truck TRK001 and provide a summary report.
