Station,001,2023-04-19T23:00:00Z,2023-04-20T05:00:00Z
Train,T101,2023-04-20T22:00:00Z,2023-04-21T04:00:00Z
...
```

Passenger Demand Forecasts (passenger_demand_forecasts.csv):
```
Route_ID,Date,Time,Forecasted_Demand
North Line,2023-04-20,06:00,300
South Line,2023-04-20,09:00,250
...
```

Based on these datasets, please call the `optimize_train_schedule` function to create an optimized train schedule that will improve our rail transportation services by addressing our goals.
