Therefore, I would like to request the use of the following functions:

1. Analyze the defect rates for ProductLineA for 2023-Q1 to understand the current state of defects.
2. Conduct an internal quality audit on the manufacturing and packaging departments to identify areas of non-compliance and implement corrective actions.
3. Monitor the compliance of ProductLineA and ProductLineB with ISO 9001 and FDA regulations to ensure all products meet regulatory standards and customer safety expectations.

