I manage a transportation business and need to optimize delivery routes for our two vehicles to ensure the most efficient use of fuel and adherence to delivery time windows. We have one vehicle with ID VH001, a capacity of 1000 units and a fuel efficiency of 10 units per liter, and another vehicle with ID VH002, a capacity of 1500 units and a fuel efficiency of 8 units per liter. We have two delivery locations, one at 123 Main St, Anytown, AN, with a delivery window between 9:00 AM and 11:00 AM, carrying 600 units. The other is at 456 Elm St, Othertown, OT, with a delivery window from 1:00 PM to 3:00 PM, carrying 800 units. Please use this data to generate optimal delivery routes that minimize fuel consumption and meet the delivery schedules.

The function details are as follows:

- Function Name: generate_optimal_routes
- Arguments:
  - vehicles: [
      { id: 'VH001', capacity: 1000, fuel_efficiency: 10 },
      { id: 'VH002', capacity: 1500, fuel_efficiency: 8 }
    ]
  - deliveries: [
      {
        location: '123 Main St, Anytown, AN',
        time_window: { start: '2023-04-15T09:00:00Z', end: '2023-04-15T11:00:00Z' },
        volume: 600
      },
      {
        location: '456 Elm St, Othertown, OT',
        time_window: { start: '2023-04-15T13:00:00Z', end: '2023-04-15T15:00:00Z' },
        volume: 800
      }
    ]

Please calculate the optimal delivery routes for our vehicles using these details.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "generate_optimal_routes", "args": {"vehicles": [{"id": "VH001", "capacity": 1000, "fuel_efficiency": 10}, {"id": "VH002", "capacity": 1500, "fuel_efficiency": 8}], "deliveries": [{"location": "123 Main St, Anytown, AN", "time_window": {"start": "2023-04-15T09:00:00Z", "end": "2023-04-15T11:00:00Z"}, "volume": 600}, {"location": "456 Elm St, Othertown, OT", "time_window": {"start": "2023-04-15T13:00:00Z", "end": "2023-04-15T15:00:00Z"}, "volume": 800}]}}]}
<|end|>


