| ENG2        | 6789 Oak St, B2  | HVAC, Electrical    | 6                  |
| ENG3        | 1357 Pine St, C3 | Plumbing, Carpentry | 7                  |
| ENG4        | 2468 Maple St, D4| Carpentry, HVAC     | 8                  |

**Current Traffic Data:**
| Route     | Traffic Condition | Delay (mins) |
