I would like to optimize our company's ground transportation logistics for our upcoming cargo shipments. We have a fleet of trucks that vary in capacity, and a list of cargo items each with a specified weight, volume, and delivery deadline to different destinations. I need a function that can calculate the most cost-effective routes to ensure timely deliveries while adhering to the truck capacities and cargo requirements. Below are the details of our trucks and cargo items:

#### Trucks:
| Truck ID | Weight Capacity (kg) | Volume Capacity (m³) |
|----------|----------------------|----------------------|
| Truck_01 | 10000                | 60                   |
| Truck_02 | 8500                 | 45                   |
| Truck_03 | 12500                | 75                   |
| Truck_04 | 9500                 | 50                   |

#### Cargo:
| Cargo ID | Weight (kg) | Volume (m³) | Destination   | Deadline   |
|----------|-------------|-------------|---------------|------------|
| C01      | 2000        | 10          | New York      | 2023-06-15 |
| C02      | 3500        | 20          | Los Angeles   | 2023-06-20 |
| C03      | 1500        | 15          | Chicago       | 2023-06-18 |
| C04      | 2500        | 25          | Houston       | 2023-06-25 |
| C05      | 4000        | 30          | Phoenix       | 2023-06-22 |

Destinations: ["New York", "Los Angeles", "Chicago", "Houston", "Phoenix"]

Please use these details to call the function to optimize the cargo routes for these shipments, considering the truck capacities and cargo specifics provided.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "optimize_cargo_routes", "args": {"trucks": [{"truck_id": "Truck_01", "capacity": {"weight": 10000, "volume": 60}}, {"truck_id": "Truck_02", "capacity": {"weight": 8500, "volume": 45}}, {"truck_id": "Truck_03", "capacity": {"weight": 12500, "volume": 75}}, {"truck_id": "Truck_04", "capacity": {"weight": 9500, "volume": 50}}], "cargo": [{"cargo_id": "C01", "weight": 2000, "volume": 10, "destination": "New York", "deadline": "2023-06-15"}, {"cargo_id": "C02", "weight": 3500, "volume": 20, "destination": "Los Angeles", "deadline": "2023-06-20"}, {"cargo_id": "C03", "weight": 1500, "volume": 15, "destination": "Chicago", "deadline": "2023-06-18"}, {"cargo_id": "C04", "weight": 2500, "volume": 25, "destination": "Houston", "deadline": "2023-06-25"}, {"cargo_id": "C05", "weight": 4000, "volume": 30, "destination": "Phoenix", "deadline": "2023-06-22"}], "destinations": ["New York", "Los Angeles", "Chicago", "Houston", "Phoenix"]}}]}
<|end|>


