I am currently overseeing our warehouse operations and need to ensure that everything runs smoothly. Specifically, I have a product with the unique identifier SKU12345, which I have verified to have 150 units in inventory. I also need to update the storage location for this item to Aisle 3, Shelf B, ensuring that it is properly tracked in our system. Additionally, there's an outstanding order with the ID ORD56789 that must be processed promptly to maintain our commitment to timely order fulfillment.

Could you please perform the following actions to assist me with these tasks:
1. Verify the inventory level for the product with ID SKU12345 to confirm that there are indeed 150 units available.
2. Update the storage location of the product with ID SKU12345 to the specified new location, which is Aisle 3, Shelf B, to reflect the change in our warehouse management system.
3. Process the order with ID ORD56789, updating the system to mark it as 'In Progress'.

I would appreciate your prompt attention to these matters to ensure efficient management of our warehouse operations.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "check_inventory", "args": {"product_id": "SKU12345"}}]}
