The tasks are as follows:
1. Record an infection incident with patient ID "PT-2023-404", infection type "nosocomial", detected on "2023-04-15", in the affected area "room 404", and categorized as "moderate" in severity.
2. Monitor the current status of the infection control protocol with ID "HHP-321" for today's date, "2023-04-20".
3. Generate an infection trend report from "2023-03-01" to "2023-04-20" including the areas of the ICU, ED, and SW.

