Here is the detailed request for each action:

1. Retrieve the current status of order "ORD12345X".
2. Update the order "ORD12345X" with the status "Dispatched" and the estimated delivery date "2023-06-15".
3. Notify client "CLIENT67890Y" with an update that their order "ORD12345X" has been dispatched and the estimated delivery date is "2023-06-15".
