1. Add a new patient record for Jane Rogers containing her personal, medical history, current medications, and allergy information.
2. Update the patient record with ID 789012 to include the latest diagnosis and treatment details.
3. Remove duplicate patient records from the specific system directory.

Please execute these functions to ensure the EHR system is up-to-date and accurate.
