As a healthcare distributor, we aim to refine our demand forecasting methods to effectively manage product stock and fulfill patient needs. We've accumulated extensive historical sales records over the past two years, complete with details on the quantity of items sold and associated dates. Our current inventory database reflects up-to-date quantities and product details for our entire range of healthcare supplies. Furthermore, we have meticulously planned promotional events for the next quarter, including anticipated sales boosts for targeted products.

To achieve our goal, we require a comprehensive demand forecast that incorporates our historical sales data, evaluates our present inventory, and takes into account the potential impact of our upcoming promotions. The forecast should span the next three months, aligning with our fiscal quarter.

For your perusal and analysis, I am providing you with the actual data in JSON format.

Historical Sales Data (historical_sales.json):
```json
{
  "sales_records": [
    {
      "product_id": "HX12",
      "date": "2022-03-15",
      "quantity_sold": 150
    },
    {
      "product_id": "BM45",
      "date": "2022-03-16",
      "quantity_sold": 200
    }
    // More records follow..
  ]
}
```

Current Inventory Levels (inventory_levels.json):
```json
{
  "inventory": [
    {
      "product_id": "HX12",
      "current_stock": 75
    },
    {
      "product_id": "BM45",
      "current_stock": 100
    }
    // Additional inventory details follow..
  ]
}
```

Promotions Schedule (promotions_schedule.json):
```json
{
  "promotions": [
    {
      "product_id": "HX12",
      "start_date": "2023-06-01",
      "end_date": "2023-06-15",
      "expected_increase": 20
    },
    {
      "product_id": "BM45",
      "start_date": "2023-06-20",
      "end_date": "2023-07-05",
      "expected_increase": 25
    }
    // Further promotion details follow..
  ]
}
```

Please use this information to generate a demand forecast for the upcoming three months.
<|end|>
