The project and the final file once exported can be identified with the title 'Event_Coverage_Final'. Following the export, I would like the file to be saved at the following location on my desktop: '/user/desktop/exports/Event_Coverage_Final_1080p.mp4'. Please proceed with the function calls to assist with this task.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "exportVideo", "args": {"project_id": "Event_Coverage_Final", "resolution": "1080p", "watermark": false}}]}
<|end|>


