```
| Name   | Age | City      | Email               |
|--------|-----|-----------|---------------------|
| Alice  | 25  | New York  | alice@example.com   |
| Bob    |     |           | bob@example.com     |
| Charlie| 30  | Vancouver |                     |
|        |     |           | dave@example.com    |
| Eve    | 35  | London    | eve@example.com     |
