Additionally, we want to gauge the performance of these portfolios to determine if we're meeting our clients' investment objectives. For this purpose, the performance metrics we are interested in are "return on investment (ROI)", "alpha", "beta", "Sharpe ratio", and "volatility". Furthermore, we wish to benchmark these portfolios against the S&P 500.

Therefore, I am seeking to call the relevant functions with the aforementioned specifics to obtain:
1. An evaluation of the current asset allocation versus the target allocation for the portfolios "P123", "P456", "P789", and "P101".
2. Calculation of the performance metrics ROI, alpha, beta, Sharpe ratio, and volatility for each of these portfolios and a comparison of their performance against the S&P 500 benchmark.

