Please perform the necessary function call to delete these expired records using a POST request as previously executed, ensuring our inventory remains current and compliant with our data retention policies.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "deleteExpiredRecords", "args": {"table_name": "Inventory", "expiry_date": "2022-01-15"}}]}
<|end|>


