I am planning an outdoor photography event at Central Park, New York and require a detailed hourly weather forecast for the upcoming 48 hours to ensure suitable conditions for capturing the best possible photos. Please provide the forecasted temperature, cloud cover percentage, and precipitation probability with metrics units. Additionally, it is vital to be aware of any potential weather alerts, such as thunderstorm warnings, that might impact the event, especially those with high severity that could pose significant risks.

Could you call the appropriate weather forecasting functions to retrieve an hourly weather forecast with the specified details for the latitude 40.785091 and longitude -73.968285 over the next 48 hours? Also, please check for any active weather alerts for the same coordinates that could affect outdoor activities. Your assistance in accessing this hyper-local weather information will be instrumental in the smooth execution of the event.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "getHourlyWeatherForecast", "args": {"latitude": 40.785091, "longitude": -73.968285, "hours": 48, "units": "metric"}}]}
<|end|>


