<|user|>
I am managing an email marketing campaign for our company and we're looking to send out personalized promotional emails to our subscribers via Google Workspace. I have prepared an email template that includes placeholders for personalization, such as the subscriber's first name and a unique discount code that we generated for this campaign. We have a list of subscribers which includes their email addresses, first names, and the corresponding unique discount codes that should be included in each email. I would like assistance with functions to generate personalized email content for each subscriber based on our template and subsequently send out these emails.

Here is the email template we plan to use, with placeholders for the subscriber's first name and discount code:

```
Dear {first_name},

We're excited to offer you an exclusive deal to start off the new season! Use your unique discount code {discount_code} at checkout to enjoy a special discount on our latest products.

Warm regards,
The [Company Name] Team
```

And here is the list of our initial subscribers in markdown format:

```
| Email              | First Name | Discount Code |
|--------------------|------------|---------------|
| jane.doe@email.com | Jane       | DISCJANE20    |
| john.smith@email.com | John     | DISCJOHN15    |
| emily.white@email.com | Emily   | DISCEMILY10   |
```

Please generate personalized email content for each subscriber using the provided template and list. Then, use Google Workspace to send out the emails from our company email address marketing@ourcompany.com with the subject line "A Special Discount Just for You!".
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "generate_personalized_content", "args": {"template": "Dear {first_name},\n\nWe're excited to offer you an exclusive deal to start off the new season! Use your unique discount code {discount_code} at checkout to enjoy a special discount on our latest products.\n\nWarm regards,\nThe [Company Name] Team", "subscribers": [{"email": "jane.doe@email.com", "first_name": "Jane", "discount_code": "DISCJANE20"}, {"email": "john.smith@email.com", "first_name": "John", "discount_code": "DISCJOHN15"}, {"email": "emily.white@email.com", "first_name": "Emily", "discount_code": "DISCEMILY10"}]}}]}
<|end|>


