Lastly, we're aiming to improve our search engine rankings, so I'd like to configure our SEO settings. For the home page, I would like to use the title 'Trendy Fashion Store - Home' and the description 'Discover the latest trends in fashion at our store. Shop new arrivals and find your style.' For the products page, the title should be 'Latest Fashion Products - Our Collection' and the description 'Explore our wide range of fashion products. Find the perfect outfit for any occasion.'

Can you assist me by calling the relevant functions to add the 'Modern Look' theme with ID '78910' to my store, set up the custom domain, and configure the SEO settings with the specific titles and descriptions provided for my Shopify store with the unique identifier '123456'?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
{"tool_calls": [{"name": "add_theme_to_store", "args": {"store_id": "123456", "theme_name": "Modern Look", "theme_id": "78910"}}]}
<|end|>


