Additionally, I need to update the inventory for one of our popular items. The inventory item ID is "808950810", and it's located at our main warehouse with the location ID "905684977". We've just restocked, and I need the available quantity to be set to 10.

Lastly, for sales performance analysis, I'd like to generate a sales report covering the period from January 1st to January 31st, 2023, to review our post-holiday sales trends.

Please execute the necessary functions to add the new Vintage Leather Jacket to our Shopify store, update the inventory level for the specified product, and generate the requested sales report for the given date range.
