Since I cannot directly access external datasets from Kaggle within this environment, you would need to download the JSON file from the given link and provide it here, so I can continue with the extraction of themes from the product reviews.

Could you please download the JSON file from the provided Kaggle link and upload it here so that I can carry out the analysis for you?
