    {"tracking_number": "1Z999AA10123456785", "carrier": "ABC Shipping", "status": "delivered", "estimated_delivery": "2023-04-05"},
    // More shipment data...
  ]
}
```

We aim to optimize our stock levels, improve supplier coordination, and enhance our logistics tracking in real-time. Could you please execute the necessary functions to analyze our inventory for better turnover rates, coordinate with our suppliers for optimal ordering schedules, and improve our shipment tracking for accurate delivery predictions?
