| 0003           | 2022-04-02 | Brown Rice     | 1        | 1.99       | 10457       | Occasional     |
| ...            | ...        | ...            | ...      | ...        | ...         | ...            |

Please return the results in a format that can be reviewed and shared with our team for strategic planning.
