 Yes, since if a crew member wears the same shirt color as another, then that second crew member also wears the same shirt color as the first. If Scotty and Uhura both wear red, then Uhura and Scotty both wear red, duh. 
21. Is sameShirtColor antisym-     metric? 
 No, for probably obvious reasons. 
