1. Let A be the set { Chuck,     Julie, Sam } and S be the set     { basketball, volleyball }.     Is { (Julie, basketball), (Sam,     basketball), (Julie, volley-     ball) } a relation between A     and S? 
 Yes it is, since it is a subset of A x S. 
2. Is the above relation an en-     dorelation? 
 No, because an endorelation involves one set with itself, not two different sets (like A and S are.) 
