 No, because Julie appears twice, mapping to two different values. 
25. Okay. Suppose we then re-     move (Julie, volleyball). We     now have { (Julie, bas-     ketball), (Sam, basketball),     (Chuck, basketball) }. Is _this_     a function? 
 Yes. Congratulations. 
26. Let's call this function     "faveSport," which suggests     that its meaning is to in-     dicate which sport is each     athlete's favorite. What's     the domain of faveSport? 
 { Julie, Chuck, Sam }. 
