 Are people in the United States more obese than they used to be? Too straightforward, not specific enough Have obesity rates increased in the United States over the last one hundred years? More specific Is there a correlation between obesity rates and economic instability in the United States over the last one hundred years? More complex answers, higher stakes, very specific 
