single complex number. 
Definition ZCV Zero Column Vector The zero vector of size m is the column vector of size m where each entry is the number zero, 
 0 = 
       0 0 0 .. . 0 
       
or defined much more compactly, [ 0 ]i = 0 for 1 <= i <= m.  
Definition CM Coefficient Matrix For a system of linear equations, 
 a 11 x 1 + a 12 x 2 + a 13 x 3 + * * * + a 1 nxn = b 1 a 21 x 1 + a 22 x 2 + a 23 x 3 + * * * + a 2 nxn = b 2 a 31 x 1 + a 32 x 2 + a 33 x 3 + * * * + a 3 nxn = b 3 .. . am 1 x 1 + am 2 x 2 + am 3 x 3 + * * * + amnxn = bm 
